// Header.astro - Top zine bar & navigation
---

<header class="w-full bg-xerox text-paper border-b-2 border-xerox px-3 sm:px-6 py-2.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs font-mono tracking-wider z-50 relative">
  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
    <a href="/" class="font-bold text-sm text-acid hover:text-paper font-mono transition-none">
